# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# ARN Stream — Android build configuration (copy to android/.env or set env vars)
# NEVER commit real secrets: android/.env is gitignored.
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Release signing (required only for signed release builds).
# In CI these come from GitHub Secrets:
#   ANDROID_KEYSTORE_BASE64, ANDROID_STORE_PASSWORD, ANDROID_KEY_ALIAS, ANDROID_KEY_PASSWORD
# Locally you can instead create `android/keystore.properties` with:
#   KEYSTORE_PATH=/absolute/path/to/release.jks
#   STORE_PASSWORD=********
#   KEY_ALIAS=upload
#   KEY_PASSWORD=********
KEYSTORE_PATH=
STORE_PASSWORD=
KEY_ALIAS=
KEY_PASSWORD=

# Gemini / AI Studio (only if you actually use the Gemini API; unused by ARN Stream)
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
